  "text": "Run a hands-off global print-on-demand business without touching a single cardboard box. Beginners assume selling merchandise requires buying bulk inventory, packing boxes, and printing shipping labels. Storing inventory ties up cash and creates dead stock when seasonal trends fade. Connect your storefront to Gelato to print and ship apparel only after customer payment clears. This creates pure passive profit while saving ten hours every week.",
